  ntfy_help_health: ["Pour une supervision externe (Uptime Kuma, Home Assistant…), l'adresse /api/health renvoie 200 si tout va bien et 503 sinon, sans connexion.", "For external monitoring (Uptime Kuma, Home Assistant…), the /api/health address answers 200 when all is well and 503 otherwise, without signing in."],
